          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You've gained the ability to place multiple talismans on an item. Normally, affixing more than one talisman to an item causes the talismans to be suppressed, but when you @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Affix a Talisman], you can specially treat one item you're working on, allowing it to have two active talismans at once. This special treatment ends if you use Affix a Talisman to treat a new item with this ability.</p>"
